  <title>8.10.3: Self Check</title>
  <metadata xmlns:md="http://cnx.rice.edu/mdml">
    <md:content-id>m02255</md:content-id>
    <md:title>8.10.3: Self Check</md:title>
    <md:uuid>9e11c974-87c9-4e93-bc44-226f6cab4e75</md:uuid>
  </metadata>
  <content>
  <section><para>A tennis ball is hit by a racket.</para>
<para>The function \(h(t) = -3t^2+ 7t + 3\) models the height in meters, \(h\), of the tennis ball \(t\) seconds after the impact with the racket.</para>
<para>Use graphing technology to determine the amount of time that has passed from the tennis ball being hit to when it reaches the ground.</para></section>
</content>
